WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.825
Step four judges the
parallel run on day one.

2
00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:06.312
Nothing connects through Entra
yet, so nothing is ready:

3
00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:08.850
zero of four, keep the parallel run going.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.187
Read the Why column.

5
00:00:10.187 --> 00:00:13.188
Every Entra principal is
not yet seen connecting.

6
00:00:13.188 --> 00:00:18.326
Contoso S V C payroll still has
forty-one remote N T L M sessions.

7
00:00:18.326 --> 00:00:22.325
And three legacy logins still carry
traffic that arrives nowhere else.

8
00:00:22.325 --> 00:00:24.675
Now look at Contoso sequel admins.

9
00:00:24.675 --> 00:00:26.963
It shows zero legacy sessions.

10
00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:28.753
Its one session was local,

11
00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:32.780
and local sessions always report
N T L M, so they don't count.
